cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it as below."
title: "cti-suite: six tools for one intelligence cycle"
abstract: >-
  A workspace of eight packages that run one CTI cycle: requirements, alias
  reconciliation, a graded ledger, a hunt plan, a STIX product and a pre-share gate.
  Every tool refuses something the cycle should not allow; the grade a claim may carry is
  capped by the evidence behind it.
